<title>USA: Presstek, Scitex in deal.</title>
<headline>Presstek, Scitex in deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scitex Corp Ltd and Presstek Inc said Tuesday that they have an agreement to cross-license certain technologies.</p>
<p>The deal calls for Presstek to license its on-press imaging patents to Scitex and for Scitex to license its turbo screening technology to Presstek, the companies said.</p>
<p>Also, the companies will cooperate in integrating the Scitex Brisque digital front end with the Pearlsetter line of off-press plate imaging systems, they said.</p>
</text>
